<title>CANADA: G.T.C. Q4 Oct 31 profit turns to loss.</title>
<headline>G.T.C. Q4 Oct 31 profit turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr  Loss		 C$0.32   Profit	C$0.35</p>
<p> Net  Loss		 10,300   Profit	13,000</p>
<p> Revs		     300,468		  299,800</p>
<p>	    12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr   Profit	    C$0.06   Profit	C$0.73</p>
<p> Net   Profit	     5,500   Profit	28,700</p>
<p> Revs		   1,050,000		  960,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is G.T.C. Transcontinental Group Ltd. Latest quarter loss and year profit include a provision of $24 million or C$0.69 a share for the loss on the disposal of the company's stake in AmerSig Graphics Inc.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
